  "title": "Crown Holdings Schedules First Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call",
  "summary": "TAMPA, Fla., March 30, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Crown Holdings, Inc. (NYSE:CCK) will release its earnings for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026, after the close of trading on the New York Stock Exchange on Monday, April 27, 2026. The Company will hold a conference call to discuss these results at 9:00 a.m.",
